        ["bst-insert"] = new("O(n · h)", "O(n)", "BuildBst inserts all n values, and each insert walks one root-to-leaf path of the tree built so far, which costs at most its height h. That is O(n · h) in total: O(n log n) while the tree stays balanced, but O(n²) in the worst case, because sorted input turns the tree into a chain and the i-th insert walks i nodes. Space is O(n) for the n nodes of the tree, plus O(h) recursion stack for the recursive insert (O(1) iterative), and h is at most n.", AlsoTime: ["O(n²)"]),
