        ["bst-delete"] = new("O(n · h)", "O(n)", "DeleteAndVerify builds the tree from the n values (n inserts at up to h steps each, O(n · h): O(n log n) balanced, O(n²) for sorted input), deletes one key and then reads the tree back in order (O(n)). The build dominates. The delete itself is O(h): one path down to find the node, then possibly another down to its successor. Space is O(n) for the tree and the in-order output, plus O(h) recursion.", AlsoTime: ["O(n²)"]),
